# upstream.diff - Aircraft Carrier Accessories (KFC) 1.9.1: original release vs the SkizzyNaval build
# a/ = GameData of the original zip (SpaceDock 1.9.1 = CKAN AircraftCarrierAccessories 1:1.9.1)
# b/ = GameData of the SkizzyNaval build
#
# Binary changes:
#   MODIFIED KFC/Plugins/ACA.dll  (rebuilt from the decompiled 1.9.1 DLL; source in src/ACA/)
#            original: 88064 bytes, sha256 C209666F6B320F887CEADFB6B6A1CBD458DE19C67408B65E5C953376D87E68E5
#            rebuilt:  84480 bytes, sha256 8FA2E4608CC5C5B277C022590FA6D7A27755EA0D5586F9FF23375975F4D9EB23
#            CLLS.OnStart: null-check the missing "Base" transform before reading its MeshRenderer.
#            Catapult: new persistent field launchGroup (default Custom07) replaces ActionGroups.groups[5]
#              (Brakes) for arming/launching; with a custom group only aircraft that have it on are hooked;
#              reset when the hooked aircraft disappears mid-launch; GetInfo describes the group.
#            Full source-level diff: compare src/ACA/ with an ILSpy decompile of the original DLL.
# Layout changes (same as CKAN's install of the original):
#   REMOVED  KFC/Resource/ResourcesGeneric.cfg  (AntiProton/GNparticle definitions, unused by ACA parts)
#   MOVED    KFC/Ships/SPH/CVN65 Enterprise.craft -> Ships/SPH/CVN65 Enterprise.craft (outside GameData)
# Text changes:
#   ADDED    KFC/Patches/zz_KSP1125_BDA113_Compat.cfg (shown below)
#
diff --git a/KFC/Patches/zz_KSP1125_BDA113_Compat.cfg b/KFC/Patches/zz_KSP1125_BDA113_Compat.cfg
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..fae3abd
--- /dev/null
+++ b/KFC/Patches/zz_KSP1125_BDA113_Compat.cfg
@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+// =====================================================================================
+// Aircraft Carrier Accessories (KFC) - compatibility patch for KSP 1.12.5 (+ BDArmory 1.13)
+// Part of the SkizzyNaval build of ACA, which also ships a rebuilt KFC/Plugins/ACA.dll.
+// Separate file on purpose: the original part configs are untouched.
+// =====================================================================================
+
+// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// 1) Enterprise carries Hangar + HangarStorage modules (Hangar mod by allista) with no
+//    guard. Without Hangar installed KSP logs "Cannot find a PartModule of typename
+//    'Hangar'/'HangarStorage'" every load and drops them anyway; remove them cleanly.
+//    With Hangar installed nothing changes (the model has trigger_hangar, hangar_space
+//    and launch_position, as those modules expect).
+// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@PART[Enterprise]:NEEDS[!Hangar]
+{
+	!MODULE[Hangar] {}
+	!MODULE[HangarStorage] {}
+}
+
+// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// 2) Catapult: the rebuilt ACA.dll arms and fires the catapult from a custom action group
+//    of the aircraft (default AG7) instead of its Brakes, which BDArmory's pilot AI sets
+//    and releases by itself. The group is a per-catapult part-menu setting
+//    ("Arm/launch with aircraft"); "Brakes" restores the original behaviour. This block
+//    only states the default and rewrites the description to match.
+//    (The CLLS start-up crash is fixed in ACA.dll itself, so the old stopgap MODEL block
+//    for CLLS is gone.)
+// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@PART[Catapult]:HAS[@MODULE[Catapult]]
+{
+	@description = Steam catapult. Stop the aircraft with a wheel on the shuttle and switch the aircraft's action group 7 on (key 7): the shuttle hooks it and its light turns yellow. Switch AG7 off again to launch; switching it on during the stroke aborts. Aircraft with AG7 off are not hooked, so AI aircraft taxi across. The group is set per catapult in the part menu ("Arm/launch with aircraft"; Brakes = the original hold-the-brakes behaviour). Installation: hide the rail under the deck and leave the block on the deck.
+	@MODULE[Catapult]
+	{
+		%launchGroup = Custom07
+	}
+}
